    </header>

    <div class="now-body">

      <h2>Work</h2>
      <p>
        Running <a href="https://www.drippingtech.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Dripping Tech</a>,
        helping Hill Country businesses figure out what AI can actually do for them. Lots of
        conversations about automation, workflow, and separating real tools from hype.
      </p>

      <h2>Learning</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Building AI-assisted workflows with n8n and Claude</li>
        <li>Exploring what autonomous agents can reliably do (and where they still fail)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Outside the screen</h2>
